  "name": "Whirlwind",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/air/wind-tornado-cyclone-purple-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Creates severe weather on a chosen hex in range, with a 5 hex radius.</p><p>Each round, every creature in the area resolves a versus test against the caster's Will + {{math spellPower \"*\" 3}}, rolling Strength or Dexterity.</p><p><strong>On the caster's success:</strong> the target is knocked Prone and pushed back one hex.</p><p><strong>On failure:</strong> the target is pushed back one hex.</p><p><strong>On failure by a margin of 50 or more:</strong> the target is not pushed at all.</p><p>The caster chooses one direction of push each round, and it is the same for every target.</p>",
